": 1948715, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15rmz.jpg"}], "slug": "taskfall", "summary": "TaskFall is a chaotic physics-based co-op game for up to four players. Players have to work together to complete dangerous missions in various hand crafted levels where unpredictable disasters, enemies, destructible environments, and your own teammates can turn every mission into a disaster.\n\nEach run throws you into a combination of tasks, locations, and unexpected hazards, making every run unique. Explore, improvise, use your equipment, and try to survive long enough to complete your objectives and extract safely. Earn money to purchase items and upgrades, then take on increasingly challenging missions.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/taskfall"}